Theatreworks, Ent Center for the Arts"},{"tag":"P","text":"Theatreworks Colorado Springs returns to the heights of musical storytelling with Stephen Sondheim’s macabre masterpiece, Sweeney Todd: The Demon Barber of Fleet Street. The production reunites the spirit of bold, immersive theatre with a “stripped down to the bleeding edge” reimagining that explores the razor-thin line between tragic hero and haunting villain."},{"tag":"P","text":"Set against the squalid, soot-stained backdrop of Victorian London — where corruption is a currency and injustice rots in the streets — Sweeney Todd follows a barber’s return from 15 years of wrongful exile. Driven by a singular thirst for vengeance against the man who shattered his life, Todd finds an unlikely, depraved ally in the pie-shop owner Mrs. Lovett. Together, they serve up a chilling new reality for London, one that leaves the city forever changed. It is a story that is as evocative as it is provocative."},{"tag":"P","text":"Read more in The Demon Barber Is Open for Business — and Theatreworks Is Ready to Draw Blood."},{"tag":"P","text":"entcenterforthearts.org"},{"tag":"H3","text":"Come From Away"},{"tag":"P","text":"Sept. 10 – Oct. 4
